1. Create a Virtual Environment with Python 3.11 : py -3.11 -m venv venv 
2. Activate the env : .\venv\Scripts\activate
3. Install dependencies : pip install -r requirements.txt
4. run API (http://127.0.0.1:8000) :  uvicorn main:app --reload 


/ model folder is also required (containing 4 DZIRIBERT finetuned models , it is 1.6 gb large)
/ python 3.11 is needed for compatibility reasons